      "text": "Wide symmetrical shot looking down the candlelit, flower-strewn aisle toward the altar where Rupert, Catherine, and the Priest stand.",
      "line_number": 14,
      "duration_ms": 1800
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP041_B002",
      "episode_id": "EP041",
      "file_index": 1,
