      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:04.50",
      "end_raw": "00:08.50",
      "start_ms": 4500,
      "end_ms": 8500,
      "text": "Medium shot tracking Catherine as she pivots toward the seated aristocracy, her veil floating gracefully behind her.",
      "line_number": 26,
      "duration_ms": 4000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP041_B005",
      "episode_id": "EP041",
      "file_index": 4,
      "scene_id": "EP041_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "CATHERINE (Haughty, Loud)",
      "speaker": "CATHERINE",
      "delivery": [
        "Haughty",
        "Loud"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:04.90",
      "end_raw": "00:08.20",
      "start_ms": 4900,
      "end_ms": 8200,
      "text": "\"Before I become Duchess of Ashburgh...\"",
      "line_number": 30,
      "duration_ms": 3300
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP041_B006",
      "episode_id": "EP041",
      "file_index": 5,
      "scene_id": "EP041_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:08.50",
      "end_raw": "00:13.00",
      "start_ms": 8500,
      "end_ms": 13000,
      "text": "Close-up of Catherine's face, her lips curling into a sadistic, triumphant sneer.",
      "line_number": 34,
      "duration_ms": 4500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP041_B007",
      "episode_id": "EP041",
      "file_index": 6,
      "scene_id": "EP041_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "CATHERINE (Cruel, Resonant)",
      "speaker": "CATHERINE",
      "delivery": [
        "Cruel",
        "Resonant"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:08.50",
      "end_raw": "00:12.70",
      "start_ms": 8500,
      "end_ms": 12700,
      "text": "\"...I want everyone to see what happens to a woman who dares defy this family.\"",
      "line_number": 38,
      "duration_ms": 4200
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP041_B008",
      "episode_id": "EP041",
      "file_index": 7,
      "scene_id": "EP041_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:13.00",
      "end_raw": "00:15.50",
      "start_ms": 13000,
      "end_ms": 15500,
      "text": "Two-shot profile of Rupert and Catherine. Rupert turns to her with mild caution.",
      "line_number": 42,
      "duration_ms": 2500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP041_B009",
      "episode_id": "EP041",
      "file_index": 8,
      "scene_id": "EP041_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "BLOND NOBLEMAN (Subdued, Inquiring)",
      "speaker": "BLOND NOBLEMAN",
      "delivery": [
        "Subdued",
        "Inquiring"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:13.20",
      "end_raw": "00:14.00",
      "start_ms": 13200,
      "end_ms": 14000,
      "text": "\"Catherine...\"",
      "line_number": 46,
      "duration_ms": 800
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP041_B010",
      "episode_id": "EP041",
      "file_index": 9,
      "scene_id": "EP041_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "CATHERINE (Callous, Projecting)",
      "speaker": "CATHERINE",
      "delivery": [
        "Callous",
        "Projecting"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:14.00",
      "end_raw": "00:15.30",
      "start_ms": 14000,
      "end_ms": 15300,
      "text": "\"Bring her in.\"",
      "line_number": 50,
      "duration_ms": 1300
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP041_B011",
      "episode_id": "EP041",
      "file_index": 10,
      "scene_id": "EP041_S01",
      "block_type": "SOUND_FX",
      "label_raw": "SOUND FX",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:15.50",
      "end_raw": "00:17.50",
      "start_ms": 15500,
      "end_ms": 17500,
      "text": "Heavy wooden creak of the cathedral double doors swinging open.",
      "line_number": 54,
      "duration_ms": 2000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP041_B012",
      "episode_id": "EP041",
      "file_index": 11,
      "scene_id": "EP041_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:15.50",
      "end_raw": "00:20.00",
      "start_ms": 15500,
      "end_ms": 20000,
      "text": "Wide shot from behind the altar down the aisle as the great church doors slowly open, revealing the silhouette of three figures against the daylight.",
      "line_number": 58,
      "duration_ms": 4500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP041_B013",
      "episode_id": "EP041",
      "file_index": 12,
      "scene_id": "EP041_S01",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:17.50",
      "end_raw": "00:20.00",
      "start_ms": 17500,
      "end_ms": 20000,
      "text": "Juliana, dressed in a coarse drab prison dress with a numbered identification badge, is marched forward by two armed constables holding her by the arms.",
      "line_number": 62,
      "duration_ms": 2500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP041_B014",
      "episode_id": "EP041",
      "file_index": 13,
      "scene_id": "EP041_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:20.00",
      "end_raw": "00:22.80",
      "start_ms": 20000,
      "end_ms": 22800,
      "text": "Extreme close-up of Juliana's scarred, dirtied wrists bound tight in heavy iron shackles.",
      "line_number": 66,
      "duration_ms": 2800
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP041_B015",
      "episode_id": "EP041",
      "file_index": 14,
      "scene_id": "EP041_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:22.80",
      "end_raw": "00:26.00",
      "start_ms": 22800,
      "end_ms": 26000,
      "text": "Intense close-up of Juliana's bruised, dirt-streaked face. Her piercing blue eyes burn with fierce dignity despite her captive state.",
      "line_number": 70,
      "duration_ms": 3200
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP041_B016",
      "episode_id": "EP041",
      "file_index": 15,
      "scene_id": "EP041_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:26.00",
      "end_raw": "00:28.80",
      "start_ms": 26000,
      "end_ms": 28800,
      "text": "Medium shot of Catherine standing beside the altar, watching Juliana's entrance with gloating satisfaction.",
      "line_number": 74,
      "duration_ms": 2800
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP041_B017",
      "episode_id": "EP041",
      "file_index": 16,
      "scene_id": "EP041_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "CATHERINE (Smug, Taunting)",
      "speaker": "CATHERINE",
      "delivery": [
        "Smug",
        "Taunting"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:26.80",
      "end_raw": "00:28.40",
      "start_ms": 26800,
      "end_ms": 28400,
      "text": "\"There she is.\"",
      "line_number": 78,
      "duration_ms": 1600
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP041_B018",
      "episode_id": "EP041",
      "file_index": 17,
      "scene_id": "EP041_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:28.80",
      "end_raw": "00:30.00",
      "start_ms": 28800,
      "end_ms": 30000,
      "text": "Medium tracking shot of Juliana marching between the stern constables down the central aisle toward the altar.",
      "line_number": 82,
      "duration_ms": 1200
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP041_B019",
      "episode_id": "EP041",
      "file_index": 18,
      "scene_id": "EP041_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:30.00",
      "end_raw": "00:34.00",
      "start_ms": 30000,
      "end_ms": 34000,
      "text": "Medium shot of a seated aristocratic couple in the pews, whispering and sneering behind an ivory lace fan.",
      "line_number": 86,
      "duration_ms": 4000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP041_B020",
      "episode_id": "EP041",
      "file_index": 19,
      "scene_id": "EP041_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "NOBLEWOMAN (Gleeful, Whispering)",
      "speaker": "NOBLEWOMAN",
      "delivery": [
        "Gleeful",
        "Whispering"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:30.50",
      "end_raw": "00:31.60",
      "start_ms": 30500,
      "end_ms": 31600,
      "text": "\"Look at her.\"",
      "line_number": 90,
      "duration_ms": 1100
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP041_B021",
      "episode_id": "EP041",
      "file_index": 20,
      "scene_id": "EP041_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "NOBLEMAN (Mocking, Chuckling)",
      "speaker": "NOBLEMAN",
      "delivery": [
        "Mocking",
        "Chuckling"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:31.70",
      "end_raw": "00:33.80",
      "start_ms": 31700,
      "end_ms": 33800,
      "text": "\"She actually came back to the chapel.\"",
      "line_number": 94,
      "duration_ms": 2100
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP041_B022",
      "episode_id": "EP041",
      "file_index": 21,
      "scene_id": "EP041_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:34.00",
      "end_raw": "00:36.80",
      "start_ms": 34000,
      "end_ms": 36800,
      "text": "Close-up of the noblewoman giggling with hand over mouth, glancing spitefully at the disgraced bride.",
      "line_number": 98,
      "duration_ms": 2800
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP041_B023",
      "episode_id": "EP041",
      "file_index": 22,
      "scene_id": "EP041_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "NOBLEWOMAN (Scornful, Smug)",
      "speaker": "NOBLEWOMAN",
      "delivery": [
        "Scornful",
        "Smug"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:34.80",
      "end_raw": "00:36.80",
      "start_ms": 34800,
      "end_ms": 36800,
      "text": "\"Not as a bride this time.\"",
      "line_number": 102,
      "duration_ms": 2000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP041_B024",
      "episode_id": "EP041",
      "file_index": 23,
      "scene_id": "EP041_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:36.80",
      "end_raw": "00:39.80",
      "start_ms": 36800,
      "end_ms": 39800,
      "text": "Medium shot of two senior aristocrats in the carved choir stalls, resting on their canes and nodding in smug agreement.",
      "line_number": 106,
      "duration_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP041_B025",
      "episode_id": "EP041",
      "file_index": 24,
      "scene_id": "EP041_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:39.80",
      "end_raw": "00:43.80",
      "start_ms": 39800,
      "end_ms": 43800,
      "text": "Close profile of Juliana as she halts in the center aisle, lifting her chin proudly to face the sneering onlookers.",
      "line_number": 110,
      "duration_ms": 4000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP041_B026",
      "episode_id": "EP041",
      "file_index": 25,
      "scene_id": "EP041_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "CATHERINE (O.S.) (Derisive, Projecting)",
      "speaker": "CATHERINE",
      "delivery": [
        "Derisive",
        "Projecting"
      ],
      "offscreen": "O.S.",
      "start_raw": "00:41.00",
      "end_raw": "00:44.20",
      "start_ms": 41000,
      "end_ms": 44200,
      "text": "\"Lady Juliana Ashcroft. Look around.\"",
      "line_number": 114,
      "duration_ms": 3200
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP041_B027",
      "episode_id": "EP041",
      "file_index": 26,
      "scene_id": "EP041_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:43.80",
      "end_raw": "00:48.50",
      "start_ms": 43800,
      "end_ms": 48500,
      "text": "High-angle wide shot showing Juliana flanked by guards in the center of the lavishly decorated nave, dwarfed by the grand cathedral.",
      "line_number": 118,
      "duration_ms": 4700
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP041_B028",
      "episode_id": "EP041",
      "file_index": 27,
      "scene_id": "EP041_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "CATHERINE (V.O.) (Mocking, Resonant)",
      "speaker": "CATHERINE",
      "delivery": [
        "Mocking",
        "Resonant"
      ],
      "offscreen": "V.O.",
      "start_raw": "00:45.00",
      "end_raw": "00:48.00",
      "start_ms": 45000,
      "end_ms": 48000,
      "text": "\"This is the world you thought you belonged to.\"",
      "line_number": 122,
      "duration_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP041_B029",
      "episode_id": "EP041",
      "file_index": 28,
      "scene_id": "EP041_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:48.50",
      "end_raw": "00:52.80",
      "start_ms": 48500,
      "end_ms": 52800,
      "text": "Low-angle medium shot of Catherine gesturing broadly from the altar steps, looking down upon Juliana like an empress.",
      "line_number": 126,
      "duration_ms": 4300
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP041_B030",
      "episode_id": "EP041",
      "file_index": 29,
      "scene_id": "EP041_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "CATHERINE (Spiteful, Boastful)",
      "speaker": "CATHERINE",
      "delivery": [
        "Spiteful",
        "Boastful"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:48.60",
      "end_raw": "00:52.40",
      "start_ms": 48600,
      "end_ms": 52400,
      "text": "\"And now they can all see what you truly are.\"",
      "line_number": 130,
      "duration_ms": 3800
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP041_B031",
      "episode_id": "EP041",
      "file_index": 30,
      "scene_id": "EP041_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:52.80",
      "end_raw": "00:57.80",
      "start_ms": 52800,
      "end_ms": 57800,
      "text": "Medium shot of Juliana standing firmly between the guards, calmly meeting Catherine's venomous gaze.",
      "line_number": 134,
      "duration_ms": 5000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP041_B032",
      "episode_id": "EP041",
      "file_index": 31,
      "scene_id": "EP041_S01",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:54.80",
      "end_raw": "00:57.50",
      "start_ms": 54800,
      "end_ms": 57500,
      "text": "Juliana looks around the cathedral at the sea of pompous faces, then raises her eyes straight back to Catherine with utter disdain.",
      "line_number": 138,
      "duration_ms": 2700
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP041_B033",
      "episode_id": "EP041",
      "file_index": 32,
      "scene_id": "EP041_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:57.80",
      "end_raw": "01:00.80",
